#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:2
msgid "存储与结果访问"
msgstr "Storage and Result Access"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:4
msgid "只想在工作台查看回放或分析报告时，先读 :doc:`results`。本页说明存储布局、写入格式与程序读取方式；外部输入数据见 :doc:`datasets`。"
msgstr ""
"To inspect replay or analysis reports in the workbench, start with :doc:`results`. "
"This page covers storage layout, write formats, and programmatic access. See "
":doc:`datasets` for external input data."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:6
msgid "读取运行目录时，先区分三类产物："
msgstr "Distinguish three kinds of run artifacts:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Replay 目录**： ``<run_dir>/replay/``。``ReplaySink`` / ``ReplayWriter`` 以 append-only "
"JSONL 写入 replay 数据，并在 ``_schema.json`` 中保存 dataset catalog 与列元数据。"
msgstr ""
"**Replay directory**: ``<run_dir>/replay/``. ``ReplaySink`` / ``ReplayWriter`` write "
"replay data as append-only JSONL and store the dataset catalog and column metadata in"
" ``_schema.json``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:11
msgid ""
"**本地工作目录**： ``<run_dir>/artifacts/``、``<run_dir>/agents/agent_<id>/``、 "
"``<run_dir>/pid.json`` 等文件，存放 ``ask`` / ``intervene`` 产物、agent workspace 与运行时元信息。"
msgstr ""
"**Local working directory**: files such as ``<run_dir>/artifacts/``, "
"``<run_dir>/agents/agent_<id>/``, and ``<run_dir>/pid.json``, which store "
"``ask``/``intervene`` artifacts, agent workspaces, and runtime metadata."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Workspace checkpoint（用于 resume）**：各 env 模块把动态状态写入 "
"``<run_dir>/env/<module>/state/ENV_STATE.json``，society 把初始化时的不可变全量写入 "
"``<run_dir>/SOCIETY.json``，并把每步标量写入 ``<run_dir>/SOCIETY_STEP.json``。这些文件都是原子 JSON 写入，仅供 "
"``--resume`` 使用，不进入 replay catalog。**Replay 面向分析，是 append-only 的时序数据；workspace 面向恢复，会覆写最新状态**。"
msgstr ""
"**Workspace checkpoint (for resume)**: each env module writes dynamic state to "
"``<run_dir>/env/<module>/state/ENV_STATE.json``. Society writes the immutable initialization "
"snapshot to ``<run_dir>/SOCIETY.json`` and per-step scalars to ``<run_dir>/SOCIETY_STEP.json``. "
"These files are atomic JSON writes used only by ``--resume`` and are not added to the replay "
"catalog. **Replay is append-only time-series data for analysis; workspace persistence is for "
"recovery and overwrites the latest state**."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:20
msgid "读取结果有三条路径："
msgstr "There are three ways to read results:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:22
msgid "后端 REST API ``/api/v1/replay/...``。推荐配合前端 / VSCode replay webview 使用。"
msgstr ""
"Backend REST API ``/api/v1/replay/...``\\ (recommended, together with the frontend or"
" the VSCode replay webview)"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:23
msgid ":class:`agentsociety2.storage.ReplayReader`，基于 DuckDB 读取 sharded JSONL。"
msgstr ":class:`agentsociety2.storage.ReplayReader`, which reads sharded JSONL with DuckDB."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:24
msgid "直接读取 workspace 中的 ``*.json`` / ``*.jsonl``，用于 agent 行为分析、调试。"
msgstr ""
"Read ``*.json`` / ``*.jsonl`` files in the workspace directly for agent behavior "
"analysis and debugging."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:28
msgid ""
"新实验不再写入 ``sqlite.db``，也不再写旧的 ``agent_profile``、``agent_status``、 ``agent_dialog`` "
"三张框架表。``agentsociety2.storage.models`` 仅保留这些历史 SQLModel 定义，供旧数据库兼容读取。"
msgstr ""
"``ReplayWriter`` no longer writes the three legacy framework tables "
"``agent_profile``, ``agent_status``, and ``agent_dialog`` for new experiments. They "
"remain in ``agentsociety2.storage.models`` only for ORM compatibility when reading "
"historical databases; equivalent data in new experiments is stored as catalog-driven "
"datasets."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:33
msgid "Run 目录布局"
msgstr "Run Directory Layout"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:35
msgid ""
"CLI 入口 ``python -m agentsociety2.society.cli`` 以 ``--run-dir`` 指定的目录作为实验 "
"HOME。``ExperimentRunner`` 会在其中创建以下结构："
msgstr ""
"The CLI entry point ``python -m agentsociety2.society.cli`` uses the directory passed"
" with ``--run-dir`` as the experiment HOME. ``ExperimentRunner`` creates the "
"following structure inside it:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:37
msgid ""
"<run_dir>/\n"
"├── replay/\n"
"│   ├── _schema.json                 # dataset catalog + table/column metadata\n"
"│   ├── core_agent_profile.<shard>.jsonl\n"
"│   ├── <prefix>_agent_state.<shard>.jsonl\n"
"│   └── <prefix>_env_state.<shard>.jsonl\n"
"├── trace/                           # 分布式 trace spans（工具/脚本/LLM 调用），trace_<xx>.jsonl 分片\n"
"├── pid.json                         # 进程信息与终止状态\n"
"├── artifacts/                       # ask / intervene / questionnaire 产物\n"
"└── agents/\n"
"    └── agent_0001/\n"
"        ├── config.json              # 静态配置（create 时写一次）\n"
"        ├── AGENT.json               # 动态自描述快照（含 world_description；每步 to_workspace 更新）\n"
"        ├── TODO.json                # 跨步任务列表（todo_* 工具持有）\n"
"        ├── MEMORY.md                # 运行时记忆摘要（由 episodes 派生）\n"
"        ├── memory/\n"
"        │   ├── episodes.jsonl       # event-level memories\n"
"        │   └── state.json           # 记忆运行时状态\n"
"        └── state/                   # 技能/自定义状态文件（如 daily_guidance/）"
msgstr ""
"<run_dir>/\n"
"├── replay/\n"
"│   ├── _schema.json                 # dataset catalog + table/column metadata\n"
"│   ├── core_agent_profile.<shard>.jsonl\n"
"│   ├── <prefix>_agent_state.<shard>.jsonl\n"
"│   └── <prefix>_env_state.<shard>.jsonl\n"
"├── trace/                           # Distributed tool/script/LLM spans in trace_<xx>.jsonl "
"shards\n"
"├── pid.json                         # Process information and terminal status\n"
"├── artifacts/                       # ask / intervene / questionnaire artifacts\n"
"└── agents/\n"
"    └── agent_0001/\n"
"        ├── config.json              # Static configuration written once by create\n"
"        ├── AGENT.json               # Dynamic snapshot with world_description; updated by "
"to_workspace each step\n"
"        ├── TODO.json                # Cross-step tasks managed by todo_* tools\n"
"        ├── MEMORY.md                # Runtime memory summary derived from episodes\n"
"        ├── memory/\n"
"        │   ├── episodes.jsonl       # event-level memories\n"
"        │   └── state.json           # Memory runtime state\n"
"        └── state/                   # Skill and custom state, such as daily_guidance/"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:60
msgid ""
"当通过后端读取实验数据时，``run_dir`` 是从 ``workspace_path`` + "
"``hypothesis_<id>/experiment_<id>/run`` 组装得到的，后端会读取其中的 ``replay/_schema.json`` 和 "
"JSONL shard。"
msgstr ""
"When experiment data is read through the backend, ``run_dir`` is assembled from "
"``workspace_path`` + ``hypothesis_<id>/experiment_<id>/run``. The backend reads "
"``replay/_schema.json`` and the JSONL shards from that directory."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:64
msgid "离线验证回放读写"
msgstr "Validate replay reads and writes offline"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:104
msgid "Replay round trip passed."
msgstr "Replay round trip passed."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:65
msgid "Replay 写入格式"
msgstr "Replay Write Format"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:111
msgid ""
"``ReplaySink`` 是每个进程本地持有的 append-only JSONL writer。``ReplayProxy`` 只携带 ``replay_dir`` "
"与启用标志，可序列化穿过 Ray task / actor 边界；每个消费者在本进程内懒加载自己的 ``ReplaySink``，不再经过中心 SQLite actor。"
msgstr ""
"``ReplaySink`` is a per-process append-only JSONL writer. ``ReplayProxy`` only carries "
"``replay_dir`` and the enabled flag, so it can be serialized across Ray task / actor boundaries; "
"each consumer lazily loads its own ``ReplaySink`` inside the current process, without going "
"through a central SQLite actor."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:71
