#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:143
msgid ""
"每个物理表写成 ``<table_name>.<shard>.jsonl``。shard 由行内容的 CRC32 计算得到，因此跨 shard 的自然顺序不保证稳定；读取时应使用 dataset"
" 的 ``default_order``、 ``step_key`` 或 ``time_key`` 显式排序。"
msgstr ""
"Each physical table is written as ``<table_name>.<shard>.jsonl``. The shard is computed from the "
"row content CRC32, so natural ordering across shards is not stable; readers should sort "
"explicitly with the dataset ``default_order``, ``step_key``, or ``time_key``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:104
msgid "常见 capability："
msgstr "Common capabilities:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:106
msgid "``agent_profile``  — agent 静态档案。"
msgstr "``agent_profile`` - static agent profiles."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:107
msgid "``agent_snapshot`` — agent per-step 状态。"
msgstr "``agent_snapshot`` - per-step agent state."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:108
msgid "``env_snapshot``   — env per-step 状态。"
msgstr "``env_snapshot`` - per-step environment state."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:109
msgid "``timeseries``     — 适合按时间轴展开。"
msgstr "``timeseries`` - suitable for timeline expansion."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:110
msgid "``geo_point``      — 含 ``lng`` / ``lat``，可在地图上画。"
msgstr "``geo_point`` - contains ``lng`` / ``lat`` and can be drawn on a map."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:111
msgid "``trajectory``     — 适合做轨迹回放。"
msgstr "``trajectory`` - suitable for trajectory replay."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:112
msgid "``entity_static``  — 一次性静态实体表。"
msgstr "``entity_static`` - one-time static entity table."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:113
msgid "``event_stream``   — 事件流。"
msgstr "``event_stream``   — event stream"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:116
msgid "写入数据"
msgstr "Writing Data"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:160
msgid ""
"环境模块的状态数据有两种写入路径： **声明式** （推荐）和 **手工注册** （事件流、自定义形状）。两条路径都调用同一个 replay writer，注入逻辑由 "
"``AgentSociety`` / 环境 router 完成。"
msgstr ""
"Environment-module state data can be written through two paths: **declarative** (recommended) and"
" **manual registration** for event streams and irregular shapes. Both paths call the same replay "
"writer; injection is handled by ``AgentSociety`` / the environment router."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:123
msgid "方式 A：声明式 ``_agent_state_columns`` / ``_env_state_columns``"
msgstr "Method A: declarative ``_agent_state_columns`` / ``_env_state_columns``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:125
msgid ""
"子类化 :class:`~agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase` 时，把希望每步写入 replay 的列声明在 class var "
"里。``EnvBase`` 会在首次写入前自动："
msgstr ""
"When subclassing :class:`~agentsociety2.env.base.EnvBase`, declare the columns you "
"want to write to replay on every step as class variables. Before the first write, "
"``EnvBase`` automatically:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:169
msgid "推导表名前缀（PascalCase → ``snake_case``，去 ``Space`` / ``Env`` / ``Module`` 后缀）。"
msgstr ""
"Derives the table-name prefix (PascalCase to ``snake_case``, removing ``Space`` / ``Env`` / "
"``Module`` suffixes)."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:129
#, python-brace-format
msgid "注册 ``{prefix}_agent_state`` 和 / 或 ``{prefix}_env_state`` 的 schema。"
msgstr "Registers the schema for ``{prefix}_agent_state`` and / or ``{prefix}_env_state``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:130
msgid ""
"调 ``register_dataset`` 写入 ``_schema.json``，capability 默认为 ``[\"agent_snapshot\", "
"\"timeseries\"]`` / ``[\"env_snapshot\", \"timeseries\"]``；如果 "
"``_agent_state_columns`` 同时声明了 ``lng`` 和 ``lat``，会额外追加 ``geo_point`` 和 "
"``trajectory``。"
msgstr ""
"Call ``register_dataset`` to write catalog metadata. The default capabilities are "
"``[\"agent_snapshot\", \"timeseries\"]`` and ``[\"env_snapshot\", \"timeseries\"]``. "
"If ``_agent_state_columns`` also declares both ``lng`` and ``lat``, ``geo_point`` and"
" ``trajectory`` are added automatically."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:135
msgid ""
"模块在 ``step()`` 中调用 ``EnvBase._write_agent_state()``、 "
"``EnvBase._write_agent_state_batch()``、``EnvBase._write_env_state()`` 即可。"
msgstr ""
"Inside ``step()``, the module only needs to call ``EnvBase._write_agent_state()``, "
"``EnvBase._write_agent_state_batch()``, or ``EnvBase._write_env_state()``."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:179
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"from typing import ClassVar\n"
"from agentsociety2.env import EnvBase\n"
"from agentsociety2.storage import ColumnDef\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"class EconomySpace(EnvBase):\n"
"    _agent_state_columns: ClassVar[list[ColumnDef]] = [\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"currency\", \"REAL\", analysis_role=\"measure\"),\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"income\", \"REAL\", analysis_role=\"measure\"),\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"consumption\", \"REAL\", analysis_role=\"measure\"),\n"
"    ]\n"
"    _env_state_columns: ClassVar[list[ColumnDef]] = [\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"bank_interest_rate\", \"REAL\", analysis_role=\"measure\"),\n"
"    ]\n"
"\n"
"    async def step(self, tick: int, t):\n"
"        records = [\n"
"            {\"agent_id\": p.id, \"currency\": p.currency,\n"
"             \"income\": p.income, \"consumption\": p.consumption}\n"
"            for p in self._persons.values()\n"
"        ]\n"
"        await self._write_agent_state_batch(self._step, t, records)\n"
"        await self._write_env_state(self._step, t,\n"
"                                    bank_interest_rate=self._bank_interest_rate)\n"
"        self._step += 1"
msgstr ""
"from typing import ClassVar\n"
"from agentsociety2.env import EnvBase\n"
"from agentsociety2.storage import ColumnDef\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"class EconomySpace(EnvBase):\n"
"    _agent_state_columns: ClassVar[list[ColumnDef]] = [\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"currency\", \"REAL\", analysis_role=\"measure\"),\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"income\", \"REAL\", analysis_role=\"measure\"),\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"consumption\", \"REAL\", analysis_role=\"measure\"),\n"
"    ]\n"
"    _env_state_columns: ClassVar[list[ColumnDef]] = [\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"bank_interest_rate\", \"REAL\", analysis_role=\"measure\"),\n"
"    ]\n"
"\n"
"    async def step(self, tick: int, t):\n"
"        records = [\n"
"            {\"agent_id\": p.id, \"currency\": p.currency,\n"
"             \"income\": p.income, \"consumption\": p.consumption}\n"
"            for p in self._persons.values()\n"
"        ]\n"
"        await self._write_agent_state_batch(self._step, t, records)\n"
"        await self._write_env_state(self._step, t,\n"
"                                    bank_interest_rate=self._bank_interest_rate)\n"
"        self._step += 1"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:167
msgid "方式 B：手工 ``register_table`` + ``register_dataset``"
msgstr "Method B: manual ``register_table`` + ``register_dataset``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:169
msgid "事件流（``kind=\"event_stream\"``）或形状不规则的数据，仍可手工注册："
msgstr ""
"Event streams with ``kind=\"event_stream\"`` and data with irregular shapes can still"
" be registered manually:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/storage.rst:212
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"from agentsociety2.storage import ColumnDef, ReplayDatasetSpec, TableSchema\n"
"\n"
"schema = TableSchema(\n"
"    name=\"social_media_event\",\n"
"    columns=[\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"id\", \"INTEGER\", nullable=False),\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"step\", \"INTEGER\", nullable=False, logical_type=\"step\"),\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"t\", \"TIMESTAMP\", nullable=False, logical_type=\"timestamp\"),\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"sender_id\", \"INTEGER\", logical_type=\"identifier\"),\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"event_type\", \"TEXT\", logical_type=\"enum\",\n"
"                  enum_values=[\"post\", \"follow\", \"like\", \"comment\", \"repost\"]),\n"
"        ColumnDef(\"payload\", \"JSON\"),\n"
"    ],\n"
